{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24451","headline":"自罢河南已换七尹每一入府怅然旧游因宿内厅偶题西壁兼呈韦尹常侍 · 白居易","name":"自罢河南已换七尹每一入府怅然旧游因宿内厅偶题西壁兼呈韦尹常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"每入河南府，依然似到家。\n杯尝七尹酒，树看十年花。\n且健须欢喜，虽衰莫叹嗟。\n迎门无故吏，侍坐有新娃。\n暖阁谋宵宴，寒庭放晚衙。\n主人留宿定，一任夕阳斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24451.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24451","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}